notes:        Generated from scratch by the contributor with Adobe After Effects 2026, driven by the generator in `tests/fixtures/tools/` (one composition per case, named like the case; tests/fixtures/CASES.md), as their own test data for the effectcraft-aep tests; contains only synthetic project structure, no third-party footage, presets, templates or personal data. No Adobe sample project or asset was used. Case 986 (a Fill switched off, which no script operation sets) is the contributor's earlier single-case file (saved by After Effects from the contributor's case 850 with the Fill's switch flag set to 0 in a copy) merged into the project by After Effects. The XMP packet after the project container was replaced by the (smaller) packet of the base project.
